# ===== ch5.7: диалоги =====
# Scene 341 - Объявление ролей

    old "Everyone, good work.\nNow then, I'll announce the final casting.{#ch5.7_w_001}"
    new "みんな、お疲れさま。\nそれでは最終的な配役の発表をします。{#ch5.7_w_001}"

    old "First, the role of Prince Kane — you, Saito!{#ch5.7_w_002}"
    new "まず、王子ケイン役には……サイトを！{#ch5.7_w_002}"

    old "…You had quite the talent.\nHave confidence in yourself.{#ch5.7_w_003}"
    new "…ああ、彼は本当に優秀だね。\n自信を持てよ。{#ch5.7_w_003}"

    old "…As for me, I'll be playing the villain —\na noble from an enemy country.\nAfter all, a play has no villain without one.{#ch5.7_w_004}"
    new "…わたしは敵国の貴族役にまわるわ。\n悪役がいないとしまらないものね。{#ch5.7_w_004}"

    old "Now, for the heroine,\nPrincess Noelle...{#ch5.7_w_005}"
    new "それでは、ヒロインの\nノエルプリンセス……。{#ch5.7_w_005}"

    # Saito internal monologue
    old "（And finally, the day of the role announcement has come）{#ch5.7_s_001}"
    new "（そして、ついに役柄の発表の日が来た）{#ch5.7_s_001}"

    old "（…How to deal with it?）{#ch5.7_s_002}"
    new "（どうなるんだろうな？\n　本当に……）{#ch5.7_s_002}"

    # Guiche
    old "W-what? It's not like I would get a part or anything...{#ch5.7_g_001}"
    new "ど、どうせぼくなんて……。{#ch5.7_g_001}"

    # Montmorency
    old "W-well, w-well now.{#ch5.7_m_001}"
    new "まぁ、そう言わない。{#ch5.7_m_001}"

    # Saito reactions
    old "H-huh? Really okay for me?{#ch5.7_s_003}"
    new "ほ、ホントにいいんですか？{#ch5.7_s_003}"